---
const { items = [] } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col-reverse md:flex-row items-center gap-12">
            <div class="md:w-1/2">
                <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Cyber Security? We've Got Your Back</h2>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                    Antivirus and other cyber security software is important for small business owners to invest in because it protects their computers and network from malware and other cyber threats. This can help prevent data loss, network outages, and other problems that can harm a business.
                </p>
                 <a href="#contact" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Learn more about our security →</a>
            </div>
             <div class="md:w-1/2">
                <img src="https://essentialtechhelp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/1.png" alt="Cyber Security" class="w-full max-w-md mx-auto" />
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
